title: AskJobStart
---
<<declare $firstTime = true>>
<<declare $currentQuestion = 0>>
<<declare $totalQuestions = 3>>
<<declare $nCorrects = 0>>
<<declare $selection = 0>>
<<declare $question = "">>
<<declare $choiceA = "">>
<<declare $choiceB = "">>
<<declare $choiceC = "">>
<<declare $choiceD = "">>
<<declare $correct = 0>>
<<if $firstTime == true>>
    <<set $firstTime to false>>
    <<jump FirstAsk>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
<<endif>>

===

title: FirstAsk
---
MuseumDirector: Welcome to the Museum.
MuseumDirector: How can I help you?
Fred: I'm Fred Donnitoly, and I'm here for the job
MuseumDirector: Do you really want to work here?
Fred: yeah I'm very enthusiastic.
MuseumDirector: ok, do you like the history?
Fred: Uhm sure.
Fred: I don't LIKE the history. I LOVE the history.
MuseumDirector: that sounds good.
MuseumDirector: Mr. Donnitoly. Do you know in what year stated the first world war?
Fred: ehh
-> 1985
-> 1200
-> I know it, it just that I dont want to say it.
MuseumDirector: what I though, you know nothing about history. 
MuseumDirector: Sorry Mr Donnitoly I can't give you the job.
<<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
===

title: SorryAdvancedQuestions
---
Fred: Can we try the questions again?
MuseumDirector: My questions are too advanced for you. And excuse me I'm very busy right now.
Fred: Ok, bye
MuseumDirector: bye.
===




title: ExamAsk
---
<<set $currentQuestion to 0>>
<<set $nCorrects to 0>>
<<set $selection to 0>>
MuseumDirector: Ok, so you think you are ready
Fred: I was born ready.
MuseumDirector: Lets start
<<jump NextQuestion>>
===



title: NextQuestion
---
<<if $currentQuestion >= $totalQuestions>>
    <<jump ExamFinished>>
<<endif>>
<<set $currentQuestion to $currentQuestion + 1>>
MuseumDirector: {$question}
-> A- {$choiceA}
    <<set $selection to 1>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> B- {$choiceB}
    <<set $selection to 2>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> C- {$choiceC}
    <<set $selection to 3>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> D- {$choiceD}
    <<set $selection to 4>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
===

title: CheckAnswer
---
<<if $selection == $correct>>
    <<set $nCorrects to $nCorrects + 1>>
<<endif>>
<<jump NextQuestion>>
===


title: ExamFinished
---
<<if $nCorrects == $totalQuestions>>
    <<jump Congrats>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Fail>>
<<endif>>
===


title: Fail
---
MuseumDirector: You fail.
MuseumDirector: You got only {$nCorrects} of {$totalQuestions}

Fred: Thanks
===



title: Congrats
---
MuseumDirector: All corrects.
MuseumDirector: All corrects, congratulation Mr Fred the job is yours
Fred: Wonderful!
===
